{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6952294f42626f7e511572318db2de870195ea14971bb7313e37c9d882466725", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n雪歩と一緒に現場入りした）", "zh": "（今天要为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》拍摄。\n和雪步一起来到现场了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d948d1ba5ecea1f48eeb1f82801c9c131ae577c534b4a4ab104b463aeb150888", "ja": "あの、{$P$}……。\n今日の撮影って、遅くまでかかりそうですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}……\n今天的拍摄，会持续到很晚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5adc060a832d4819d3157cbdcfa9141310d80679f248533f80f526ab5b7dfc26", "ja": "うーん、どうだろう？　そう遅くならないはずだけど、\n撮り直しがあるとわからないな。", "zh": "嗯——不好说呢？应该不会太晚，不过要是需要重拍，就不确定了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ecc3c584713d38d2971bfcaff1d6b10098e46dbd54f1aaf503aa798ce34d74a2", "ja": "そうなんですね……。\nうう、暗くなる前に終わるといいなぁ……。", "zh": "这样啊……  \n呜，希望能在天黑之前结束……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ca6927b16bec15987a68cbc341d408130895e9d4784829bfda071f711f80de94", "ja": "ん？　何か用事でもあるのか？", "zh": "嗯？你还有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "980ca4033a2b7acc29bfa403e6f5a76981c10829dfb3595e8e2b52a764208d21", "ja": "そういうわけじゃないんですけど……\n夜の学校って、何か……いるような気がしたり……。", "zh": "倒也不是有事……\n只是觉得晚上的学校里，好像有什么……存在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ce5ef6278a6dbd6df401195662eb4e519f9458ff6fc4b825a38485375c260de3", "ja": "……ああ、おばけ的な？", "zh": "……啊，像幽灵那样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f66e8b3e34114ba6d3eaddf6b1199ab24fdc13fb685cc3e85e185b218010342f", "ja": "ひう！　言っちゃダメですぅ！\nウワサをしたら、呼ばれたと思って出て来ちゃうって！", "zh": "咿——！不能说出来啦！\n要是谈论它们，它们会以为有人叫自己，就跑出来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1008_p", "source_sha256": "21798e4a912e89a8028f8913210619574e3566a928ebd09d9b7b1e14c187ff18", "ja": "あ、ああ、ごめんごめん。\n確かに夜の学校って、ちょっと不気味だよな。", "zh": "啊、啊啊，抱歉抱歉。\n确实，晚上的学校有点吓人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0752f701963a6c3c4e7c5659b394c089e71443a9447991558d60b38f85e492d1", "ja": "はい……。前に、課題のノートを学校に忘れて、\n放課後取りに行ったことがあるんですけど……", "zh": "是……以前有一次把作业本忘在学校里，放学后回去拿，结果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0f195dee87ae39037c249980b9f251794f3415d87f384b645997cd34613d2c8e", "ja": "学校の中に入ったら、暗いし、静かだし\nだんだん怖くなっちゃって……！", "zh": "走进了学校里面之后，又昏暗，又安静，\n我就渐渐觉得害怕起来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1011_p", "source_sha256": "79541d330cc7ed4bc361e2c3d3f4ecc70fbcd322bc6edf88e384fe02556fff9d", "ja": "そうか……よし、それなら今日は、\nなるべく雪歩の近くにいるよ。それならいいだろ？", "zh": "这样啊……好，那今天我会尽量待在雪步身边。这样可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2ce966c63a23abc111391e2946a6fa119acc77e93b33356ec483518b76794df9", "ja": "あ……はい、ぜひお願いします！　よかった、\n{$P$}が一緒なら、安心ですぅ。", "zh": "啊……好的，那就拜托您了！太好了，和{$P$}一起的话，我就安心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "067408b3014048f6e91f3f6cc5b23ad347f278010f78974338cbcddce72ea1ec", "ja": "だって、学校に出るのは生徒のおばけだから……。\n{$P$}より年下ですもんね！", "zh": "因为，出现在学校里的都是学生的鬼魂……比{$P$}年纪小嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fbaa7c6c3f4d901727198207cd9143b6c1059ed88756dd388d6a7839baa6d2f7", "ja": "うん？　まあ……そうかもな！\nおばけに年下とか、あるのかどうかはともかく……。", "zh": "嗯？不过……或许吧！\n先不说幽灵有没有年龄之分……、】【", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "70003a29c036865cb50f934d8c2d4c093be804191b0191548c09cc8ee9a3b14f", "ja": "あ、でも先生のおばけだったら「何をしてるんだ！」て\n{$P$}が叱られちゃうかも……！？", "zh": "啊，不过要是老师的幽灵，{$P$}可能会被训斥“你在干什么！”……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8fec2a6e2c1e31d0c98cc30b183d59ce65d8bee2c689075efc907b66f5788d4b", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。ちゃんと許可を取って撮影してるから。\n校長先生のおばけだって、説得するよ。", "zh": "没事的。因为我们是好好取得了许可才来拍摄的。\n就算是校长幽灵，我也会说服他的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f129131baa2bfad76afb9cd756b4d18865a8720e437557bd8dd96a475c5fe34e", "ja": "わぁ、それなら……あ、でもでも、\n女の子のおばけは、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "哇，那样的话……啊，可是可是，\n女孩子的幽灵，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "11e4e6bc167ba701f9c88aebfe9218908da4b4f6308366648ae588827bbc74c4", "ja": "もしかしたら「SNSでバエたい……」とか言って\n出てきて、心霊写真になっちゃうかも……はううっ。", "zh": "说不定会说着“想在社交媒体上出片……”之类的话跑出来，结果变成灵异照片……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0f6afbbacda2457ccee6f8473590909d94f4402f299af42fca80cece4c98527c", "ja": "なるほど、今どきだしな……。\nでもそれなら、スカウトしてみるよ。", "zh": "原来如此，确实很符合现在的潮流……\n不过既然这样，那我就去试着招募她吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f23f26c1b78cd68896f43fdff9d3e11a37f58df669e329a35e391c793c23d937", "ja": "スカウト……えええっ！？\nおばけをアイドルにしちゃうんですか！？", "zh": "招募……诶诶诶！？\n要把鬼变成偶像吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7137cb796ba30e2865224769bc1bf86e8a9b1416a8ee2b1270a45615f1d3ec78", "ja": "ああ、断られるかもしれないけど、\nもし仲間になってくれたら、心強いだろ？", "zh": "啊，虽然可能会被拒绝，\n但如果她愿意成为伙伴的话，不是会让人很安心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "703594257675894d6b85b73ae831db1b1a6db535ca9dd354eeb416c257e442e0", "ja": "あ……。そ、そうですね。\nおばけのアイドル仲間……ふふっ。", "zh": "啊……嗯、是啊。幽灵偶像伙伴……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3077771e318798dcbe052a55ca8ed2e425bcd481519de14981018080c604491b", "ja": "{$P$}。私、友達になれるかもって\n思ったら……ちょっと平気になってきた気がします。", "zh": "{$P$}。我一想到说不定能和它成为朋友……就感觉自己渐渐没那么害怕了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1024_p", "source_sha256": "824fa36c2d4e1429b030700869680011191bd32109526d4bd24dacd8374fe94b", "ja": "おっ、それはよかった。\nさて、そろそろ撮影だけど、頑張れそうか？", "zh": "哦，那就好。差不多要开始拍摄了，你能加油吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0153_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e80c534852644f57044603d9e4e60331adbe5094b3eccee9b20134d9fae13d4f", "ja": "はい、頑張りますね♪　……あ、で、でもあの、\n撮影の間、ちゃんと近くにいてくださいねっ？", "zh": "好的，我会努力的♪……啊，不过、那个，\n拍摄的时候，请一定要待在我身边哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
